{"seq":2,"slug":"blueprint-prefab","title":"蓝图与预制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-data-driven-design/patterns/blueprint-prefab","wordCount":1707,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"蓝图与预制\">蓝图与预制</h1><p>一张表能把一千件「形状相同」的装备管得井井有条，但当你要描述的是一个敌人——它有一个会动的身体、一把会开火的武器、一套会追玩家的 AI、一圈受击判定、一段死亡掉落——表就崩溃了：这些部件结构各异、互相嵌套，硬塞进一行只会逼出几十个大部分为空的列。这时数据驱动需要换一种组织方式：不再是「行与列」，而是「模板与组合」。预制（prefab）与蓝图（blueprint）就是用来描述这种异构、可组合、可继承的对象的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-组合优于继承的数据版\">核心概念：组合优于继承的数据版</h2><p>预制的本质是把一个复杂对象的「配方」存成数据：它由哪些<strong>组件</strong>（component）拼成，每个组件的参数是什么，整体叫什么名字。生成时引擎按这份配方把组件一个个装上去，得到一个实例。这是「组合优于继承」思想在数据层的体现——一个敌人不是某个庞大 Enemy 类的子类，而是「Transform + Health + Weapon + AI + Loot」这几个组件按数据拼出来的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[goblin.prefab&lt;br/&gt;预制定义] --&gt; B[Transform 组件&lt;br/&gt;缩放0.8]&#10;  A --&gt; C[Health 组件&lt;br/&gt;maxHp 80]&#10;  A --&gt; D[Weapon 组件&lt;br/&gt;引用 dagger]&#10;  A --&gt; E[AI 组件&lt;br/&gt;行为 melee_rush]&#10;  A --&gt; F[Loot 组件&lt;br/&gt;引用掉落表]&#10;  B &amp; C &amp; D &amp; E &amp; F --&gt; G[实例化&lt;br/&gt;装配成一只哥布林]\">flowchart TD\n  A[goblin.prefab&lt;br/&gt;预制定义] --&gt; B[Transform 组件&lt;br/&gt;缩放0.8]\n  A --&gt; C[Health 组件&lt;br/&gt;maxHp 80]\n  A --&gt; D[Weapon 组件&lt;br/&gt;引用 dagger]\n  A --&gt; E[AI 组件&lt;br/&gt;行为 melee_rush]\n  A --&gt; F[Loot 组件&lt;br/&gt;引用掉落表]\n  B &amp; C &amp; D &amp; E &amp; F --&gt; G[实例化&lt;br/&gt;装配成一只哥布林]</pre><p>注意 <code>Weapon</code> 组件里只是<strong>引用</strong>了 <code>dagger</code>——而 <code>dagger</code> 本身可能是一张装备表里的一行。预制把表驱动的「同构属性」和组合的「异构结构」缝合起来：表管叶子的数值，预制管对象的骨架。表驱动撑不住的地方，正是从这里接手的，承接 <a href=\"table-driven-design\">表驱动设计</a> 留下的天花板。这种「对象由组件数据拼成」的思路，与运行时 ECS 把实体看成组件集合是同源的面向数据世界观，对比见 <a href=\"../../entity-component-system/foundations/oop-vs-data-oriented\">ECS · 面向对象 vs 面向数据</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"原型与覆盖-基于模板微调而不复制\">原型与覆盖：基于模板微调而不复制</h2><p>预制真正强大的地方，是**覆盖（override）**机制带来的「原型继承」。你定义一个基础哥布林预制，然后做一个「精英哥布林」——它不复制一份完整定义，而是声明「我就是哥布林，只不过血量翻倍、加一个护盾组件、武器换成大刀」。基础预制改了什么（比如哥布林整体调了模型），所有变体自动继承，除非某个变体显式覆盖了那一项。</p>\n<p>这套机制省下的是海量重复。下表对比有无覆盖：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>无覆盖（复制粘贴）</th>\n<th>有覆盖（原型+差异）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>做 5 种哥布林变体</td>\n<td>5 份完整定义</td>\n<td>1 基础 + 5 份差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改基础哥布林模型</td>\n<td>改 5 处，易漏</td>\n<td>改 1 处，自动传播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>看清某变体改了啥</td>\n<td>全文 diff</td>\n<td>只看覆盖列表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套变体（变体的变体）</td>\n<td>指数级膨胀</td>\n<td>链式覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>覆盖的语义可以形式化：一个实例的最终属性值，是沿原型链从基到子逐层应用差异的结果。若记基础为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>、各级覆盖为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_1, \\Delta_2, \\dots, \\Delta_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则最终配置</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⊕</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = B \\oplus \\Delta_1 \\oplus \\Delta_2 \\oplus \\cdots \\oplus \\Delta_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊕</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span></span></span></span></span> 是「后者覆盖前者同名字段、保留未提及字段」的合并操作。理解这个合并语义是用好预制的关键——也是它最容易出 bug 的地方，下一节细说。</p>\n<h2 id=\"引擎实现-unity-prefab-variant-与-unreal-blueprint\">引擎实现：Unity Prefab Variant 与 Unreal Blueprint</h2><p>两大引擎都把这套机制做成了核心工作流，名字不同但骨架一致。</p>\n<p>Unity 的 <strong>Prefab</strong> 加 <strong>Prefab Variant</strong> 正是上面说的原型+覆盖：Variant 基于一个基础 Prefab，只记录差异（override），基础改动会传播到所有 Variant，除非被局部覆盖。嵌套 Prefab（Nested Prefab）则让你把小预制拼成大预制，组合层层向上。Unreal 的 <strong>Blueprint</strong> 类继承（Child Blueprint）走的是同一条路：子蓝图继承父蓝图的组件与默认值，只覆写需要改的属性。需要提醒的是，Unreal 的 Blueprint 同时承载了可视化脚本逻辑——那部分（事件图里的节点连线）已经越过了纯数据，属于 <a href=\"../foundations/data-driven-spectrum\">数据驱动光谱</a> 偏右的刻度，本篇只关注其作为「组件+默认值模板」的数据侧。</p>\n<p>无论哪个引擎，预制资产通常以引擎自有的序列化格式存储，编辑时强类型、可视化；要让它们高效加载到运行时，同样要走打包与烘焙，见 <a href=\"../practice/data-driven-performance\">性能与烘焙</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"覆盖的暗面-调试与-覆盖蔓延\">覆盖的暗面：调试与「覆盖蔓延」</h2><p>预制不是免费的优雅，它把一类新麻烦带进了数据驱动：<strong>实例的最终值不再一目了然</strong>。一只精英哥布林当前 <code>maxHp</code> 是多少，你没法只看它自己的定义得到答案——你得顺着原型链一路追：基础哥布林给了 80，精英变体覆盖成 160，这个场景里的某个特殊摆放又局部覆盖成 200。表驱动的「一行看全」优势在这里消失了，这是组合换来的代价。</p>\n<p>更阴险的是<strong>覆盖蔓延</strong>：当太多实例对基础预制做了零散覆盖，基础预制就失去了意义——你改基础的某项，发现大半实例都覆盖了它、改了等于没改。诊断信号是「override 列表长得吓人」。还有一类经典 bug 是覆盖与传播的预期错位：策划以为改基础会传到所有变体，结果某个变体早就覆盖了那一项，于是「怎么改基础那个怪没变」。</p>\n<p>实用的纪律有三条：覆盖要少而有意（能进基础的共性就别散落到变体）、定期审视并「上提」共性覆盖回基础、给策划提供「这个值从原型链哪一层来」的可视化（这正是好的编辑工具该做的，见 <a href=\"../practice/authoring-tools\">编辑工具</a>）。这些都是为了对抗组合带来的「最终值不透明」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>预制/蓝图用「模板+组件组合」描述表驱动撑不住的异构、嵌套对象，是组合优于继承在数据层的体现，对应光谱刻度 3。</li>\n<li>预制引用表里的叶子数值：表管同构属性、预制管对象骨架，两者缝合。</li>\n<li>覆盖机制实现原型继承——变体只存与基础的差异，最终值是沿原型链逐层合并 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⊕</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=B\\oplus\\Delta_1\\oplus\\cdots\\oplus\\Delta_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，省下海量重复。</li>\n<li>引擎实现：Unity Prefab+Prefab Variant+Nested Prefab、Unreal Blueprint 子类继承（注意 Blueprint 的脚本逻辑部分已越过纯数据）。</li>\n<li>代价是最终值不透明（需追原型链）与覆盖蔓延：纪律是覆盖少而有意、定期上提共性、给策划提供来源可视化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章上一篇：<a href=\"table-driven-design\">表驱动设计</a> —— 预制接手的正是表驱动的天花板。</li>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"data-driven-events\">数据驱动事件</a> —— 当对象还需要可数据化的行为时。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../entity-component-system/foundations/oop-vs-data-oriented\">ECS · 面向对象 vs 面向数据</a> —— 「对象即组件集合」世界观的运行时版本。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"蓝图与预制","id":"蓝图与预制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：组合优于继承的数据版","id":"核心概念-组合优于继承的数据版"},{"level":2,"text":"原型与覆盖：基于模板微调而不复制","id":"原型与覆盖-基于模板微调而不复制"},{"level":2,"text":"引擎实现：Unity Prefab Variant 与 Unreal Blueprint","id":"引擎实现-unity-prefab-variant-与-unreal-blueprint"},{"level":2,"text":"覆盖的暗面：调试与「覆盖蔓延」","id":"覆盖的暗面-调试与-覆盖蔓延"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"表驱动设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-data-driven-design/patterns/table-driven-design"},"next":{"title":"数据驱动事件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-data-driven-design/patterns/data-driven-events"}}